---
import Legal from "../../layouts/Legal.astro";
import { SITE } from "../../lib/site";
---

<Legal lang="en" title="Privacy" path="/en/privacy">
  <p>We collect only the data needed to calculate and deliver your plan. We do not use cookies or advertising trackers.</p>

  <h2>Controller</h2>
  <p>{SITE.operator}. Privacy contact: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>

  <h2>What data we process</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <b>Preview calculation:</b> distance, goal time, race date, weekly volume, running days, an optional recent result and gel settings.
      The server uses them for the calculation and does not store them. It only records that a preview was calculated, with language and
      distance, without IP address and without a visitor identifier.
    </li>
    <li>
      <b>Purchase:</b> the data above, language, plan start date, order number, payment status, amount and the email address provided by the
      payment provider. If you use a referral code, we store it too.
    </li>
    <li><b>Ticks</b> you set on the “My plan” page.</li>
    <li>
      <b>In your browser</b> (localStorage, not cookies): your chosen language and theme. This stays in your browser and is not sent to us.
    </li>
    <li>
      <b>Technical data:</b> for each request the host processes your IP address and browser data to deliver the site and protect it from
      abuse.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Purpose and legal basis</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Calculating and delivering the plan and saving ticks: performance of a contract (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR).</li>
    <li>Accounting records of purchases: legal obligation (Art. 6(1)(c) GDPR).</li>
    <li>Aggregate visit statistics without personal data and site protection: legitimate interest (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Processors</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Cloudflare, Inc.: website hosting and database (Western Europe region).</li>
    <li>{SITE.paymentProvider}: payment, invoice and VAT. It is an independent controller for payment data; we never see your card number.</li>
    <li>An email delivery provider, once delivery by email is enabled.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Where data is transferred outside the EU, this is based on standard contractual clauses or other lawful mechanisms.</p>

  <h2>Retention</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We keep order data and ticks while you have access to your plan, or as long as accounting law requires.</li>
    <li>Ticks are deleted together with the order.</li>
    <li>Event statistics contain no personal data.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can request access to your data, correction, erasure, restriction or portability, and object to processing based on legitimate
    interest. Write to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> from the address you paid with. You can lodge a complaint with the
    Slovenian Information Commissioner (ip-rs.si) or the supervisory authority in your country.
  </p>
</Legal>
